3. 上游许可冲突 / License conflict in the upstream project
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

*** IMPORTANT / 重要 ***

The upstream project declares TWO conflicting licenses:

  (1) Its README states: "本项目采用MIT许可证。" (This project uses the MIT License.)
  (2) The LICENSE file shipped in its repository is the full text of the
      GNU AFFERO GENERAL PUBLIC LICENSE Version 3 (AGPL-3.0), carrying the
      copyright line "Copyright (C) 2022-2099 AstrBot Plugin Authors".
      GitHub's own license detection reports the upstream repository as
      AGPL-3.0.

上游项目的许可声明存在冲突：其 README 声称采用 MIT 许可证，但其仓库中随包分发的
LICENSE 文件实为 GNU AGPL-3.0 全文（GitHub 官方检测亦判定该仓库为 AGPL-3.0）。
据推断，该 AGPL-3.0 文件大概率为 AstrBot 插件脚手架所带、原作者未作替换。

THIS DERIVATIVE PROJECT ELECTS TO FOLLOW THE UPSTREAM README'S MIT DECLARATION.
本二开项目选择按上游 README 的 MIT 声明执行，即视上游代码以 MIT 许可证授权。

Accordingly, and in order to fully preserve the upstream license text as
required, the upstream LICENSE file is retained in this repository VERBATIM,
without a single byte modified, at:

    third_party/LICENSE-astrbot_plugin_txsc-AGPL-3.0.txt

