路径（34,531 字节，未作任何修改）。

IF THE UPSTREAM AUTHOR CONFIRMS THAT AGPL-3.0 IS THE INTENDED LICENSE, this
project will be relicensed accordingly, since AGPL-3.0 is a strong copyleft
license that requires the entire derivative work to remain under AGPL-3.0.

